 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "Someone stole 18 million dollars of maple syrup, and nobody noticed.",
   "s": 0.12,
   "e": 4.009
  },
  {
   "text": "The barrels never moved. Thousands, stacked to the ceiling.",
   "s": 4.309,
   "e": 6.773
  },
  {
   "text": "The world's emergency syrup stash, guarded day and night.",
   "s": 7.073,
   "e": 9.625
  },
  {
   "text": "Until an inspector climbed the stack to count them.",
   "s": 9.925,
   "e": 11.963
  },
  {
   "text": "He bumped one barrel, and it flew off like a balloon.",
   "s": 12.263,
   "e": 13.939
  },
  {
   "text": "Way too light. So he pried it open.",
   "s": 14.239,
   "e": 15.777
  },
  {
   "text": "Water. He opened another. Water again.",
   "s": 16.427,
   "e": 18.131
  },
  {
   "text": "So where did all the syrup go?",
   "s": 18.431,
   "e": 19.642
  },
  {
   "text": "Thieves had siphoned it out, refilling every barrel with water.",
   "s": 20.062,
   "e": 22.795
  },
  {
   "text": "Then they sold it, truck by truck, right under everyone's noses.",
   "s": 23.095,
   "e": 25.96
  },
  {
   "text": "And that's how you steal syrup without anyone noticing.",
   "s": 26.26,
   "e": 28.703
  }
 ],
